  {
    "group": "Nightmare",
    "level": 5,
    "name": "Nightstalker",
    "flavor": "Nightmares are personal. They are intimate failures of the mind to protect itself from fear. But the masters of Nightmare have learned a far crueler art: to reach into the fragile psyche of a victim, to pull forth the private horrors buried in the folds of memory and give them form.\n\nThe vampire does not simply haunt the victim's sleep. They forge the nightmare into a tangible specter, an autonomous terror that stalks the victim's waking world. It whispers behind closed doors. It lurks at the edge of their vision. And it follows not just the victim, but all they love, breaking minds and bodies in its slow pursuit.\n\nThis horror cannot be reasoned with. It is the victim's own dread fed, twisted, and weaponized now loose in the world. The vampire merely watches, as lives unravel under the touch of monster that never existed. .. until now.",
