    "failureText": "You know, maybe clowns aren't that scary after all... As Success, but the vampire loses temporary control of the spawned nightmare. The Storyteller selects one unintended loved one, ally, or dependent of the vampire. The manifested nightmare will stalk both the victim and this person for the full duration.",
    "successText": "The vampire gives shape to the victim's personal nightmare, which detaches from sleep and invades waking life. The manifested horror begins stalking the victim and all those emotionally or socially connected to them. Every day, the horror appears, harasses, or attacks in minor or severe ways at the Storyteller's discretion, causing dread, sleeplessness, paranoia, social alienation, and in some cases physical harm.\n\nThe victim may attempt to resist the nightmare's influence each day by rolling Wits + Resolve. If their accumulated successes ever equal or exceed the vampire's original Nightstalker roll, the nightmare dissolves back into memory. See next page for example Nightstalkers... While the nightmare persists: The victim suffers —2 to all social and mental actions due to exhaustion and dread. All close associates may suffer Compel-I or Compel-2 'There's something hunting us. effects. The nightmare cannot be physically harmed. Only by resisting it through the resistance roll above can it be banished.",
    "notes": "Range: Victim must be within I mile at activation, but may be haunted anywhere thereafter.\n\nAttack Dice Pool: 8 (bone hooks, flaying strike) deals Aggravated damage\n\nHooks of Memory: Each successful attack strips one \"layer\" of self-control: target suffers —1 cumulative penalty to Resolve\n\nInescapable: Victims may not run farther than 50 yards per scene; dream-logic always returns them to its reach.\n\nScent of Blood: Automatically detects hiding prey within 30 feet.\n\nVictim experiences nerve pain even while\n\nVictim suffers Compel-2 (\"They will skin me alive. until released. The Hollow Mother The Flayed Man The victim's nightmare of failing to protect their family becomes a maternal wraith that stalks and mutilates their loved ones, whispering that it is \"keeping them safe.\" Type: Torturer Type: Wraithlike Predator Size: 5 (tall, emaciated, hollow-eyed) Defense: 2 Defense: 3 Health: 12 Health: 8 Speed: 8 Speed: 10 Initiative: 1 Initiative: 2\n\nAttack Dice Pool: 6 (raking talons) — deals Lethal damage Abilities: Abilities:\n\nMother's Touch: On a successful attack, the Hollow Mother may inflict permanent disfigurement or broken bones per hit. that require surgery or supernatural healing.\n\nProtective Rage: If a loved one of the victim is present, the Hollow Mother gains 42 dice to attacks.\n\nSilent Arrival: May enter locked homes or secure rooms without being noticed. Narrative Effect: Victims may only detect her with Wits + Composure (—3). awake.\n\nNarrative Effect: Crime scenes Family members begin accusing each mutilation. other of abuse.\n\nChildren report seeing ' 'Mommy in the walls.\"\n\nVictim suffers Compel-2 (\"l am failing them.\" ) until the nightmare is banished. The Faceless Parade The victim's fear of being erased or forgotten creates a group of identical, faceless figures who stalk public spaces, whispering the victim's secrets to strangers.\n\nType: Swarm of Manifestations Size: Variable (appears as 5—10 figures) Defense: 1 Health: 2 each Speed: 12 Initiative: 3\n\nAttack Dice Pool: 5 (suffocating embrace) — deals Bashing damage Abilities:\n\nWhispers of Exposure: Each encounter broadcasts an embarrassing secret of the victim to someone they know.\n\nDissolve and Reform: If any figure is destroyed, it reforms in 1 hour somewhere near the victim.\n\nSuffocating Presence: If 3 or more swarm together, target must roll Stamina 4- Resolve or fall unconscious for 1 hour.\n\nNarrative Effect: Friends and coworkers turn on the victim as secrets spread. suggest ritualistic Public reputation collapses.\n\nVictim suffers Compel-2 (\"Everyone knows. throughout the nightmare's existence.",
