    "dicePoolSkill": "Persuasion",
    "dicePoolDiscipline": "Quietus",
    "actionText": "The vampire must focus their intent upon a target they can see or have made eye contact with during this scene. Activation is instant.",
    "failureText": "As Success, but the stolen silence resonates backward. The vampire's mind fractures between echoing voids and phantom noises. For the remainder of the scene, the vampire suffers a Compel -2 (chosen by the Storyteller) reflecting confusion, disorientation, or intrusive thoughts.",
    "successText": "The target loses all ability to hear. No sound reaches them whether mundane, mystical, or internal. Sorcerous chants, whispered warnings, and shouted commands vanish into the black hush. For the remainder of the scene, the target suffers to all actions due to disorientation and impaired situational awareness.",
