      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "group": "Quietus",
    "level": 2,
    "name": "Eternal Darkness",
    "flavor": "Sound is the first comfort of the living: breath, voice, heartbeat. But when sound is stolen, sight remains as the last anchor to reality. Eternal Darkness strips that final lifeline away.\n\nThose who wield this power become not simply hunters, but unmakers. They do not assault the body; they erode existence itself. Light dies, forms vanish, even the mind's eye goes blind. The victim is left in a world without shape, without depth, without meaning—a void of perfect absence where only terror remains.",
