    "dicePoolAttribute": "Charisma",
    "dicePoolDiscipline": "Quietus",
    "actionText": "The vampire must fix their gaze upon the target for several uninterrupted seconds, forcing the weight of absence upon them.",
    "failureText": "As Success, but the backlash of the void surges into the vampire's own mind. The predator suffers a Compel -3 (chosen by the Storyteller), reflecting episodes of vertigo, hallucinations, or temporary visual and auditory distortions for the remainder of the scene.",
    "successText": "The target is plunged into total sensory deprivation. They lose all hearing and all sight, including any mental or mystical perception of space. The world becomes an infinite, black silence. For the duration of the scene, the target suffers -3 to all actions, forced to rely solely on touch, instinct, and desperation to function.",
    "sourcePage": 169,
