        "effect": "The darkness reaches into the target's sense of balance and spatial awareness. Movement becomes agonizingly uncertain; any attempt to move more than a step requires a Dexterity + Athletics roll (Difficulty 2) or they fall prone. The vampire may expand the effect slightly outward. Any attempt by others to communicate or guide the victim through touch or physical contact suffers a -2 dice penalty. The vampire may fracture the victim's mind further. Each time the victim attempts to act while affected, the Storyteller may call for a Resolve + Composure roll. Failure results in temporary panic, leaving the victim unable to act that turn."
      }
    ]
