    "failureText": "As Success, but fragments of sensory oblivion bleed into the vampire's own perception. For the remainder of the scene, the vampire suffers a Compel -4 (chosen by the Storyteller) , reflecting partial numbness, vision loss, or existential vertigo as their own grasp on reality falters.",
    "successText": "The victim is plunged into total deprivation. All senses are extinguished. They cannot see, hear, feel, taste, or smell. Even their sense of gravity and body position dissolves. The target becomes helpless, unable to meaningfully interact with their environment, suffering a -4 penalty to all actions for the remainder of the scene. Movement becomes nearly impossible without external aid.",
