    "level": 2,
    "name": "Wrath of Hecatonchire",
    "flavor": "The ancients whispered of those monstrous titans of impossible form, their hundred arms casting down the arrogant and the proud. They were not artisans of war. They were bludgeons of raw, elemental force, living avalanches that hurled gods from their thrones.\n\nThe Kindred who call upon this echo of forgotten fury strike not merely to wound but to displace. Each blow is a commandment of gravity itself—a demand that bodies move where the Beast wills. Bones fracture, air bursts from lungs, and the ground rises to meet the defeated like a waiting grave.\n\nIn this moment, the vampire becomes not a warrior, but a cataclysm.",
    "vitaeCost": 1,
