    "failureText": "As Success, but the Beast misjudges its fury. The vampire's attack lands, but their own footing slips under the backlash of force. After resolving the attack, the vampire suffers Defense until their next action.",
    "successText": "The vampire's strike crashes into the target with tremendous impact. If the attack lands successfully, the target must immediately make a Dexterity Athletics roll, with a dice pool penalty equal to the number of successes scored by the vampire on the attack roll. On a failed defense roll, the target is hurled backward I yard per success scored by the vampire (5+ yards shifts the target from Close to Near Zone, per WoD Combat Ranges). They take normal damage from the attack.",
    "sourcePage": 197,
    "bonusOptions": [
      {
