        "effect": "The target is also rendered prone upon landing, losing their next action to recover. The target suffers a -2 penalty to Defense until their next action as they struggle to regain footing. The strike's shockwave knocks over unsecured objects or individuals within 2 yards of the target, forcing them to roll Dexterity + Athletics or fall prone. The vampire may choose to redirect the trajectory, flinging the target into a specific hazard, obstacle, or additional enemy within range. If contact is made, resolve additional damage as appropriate."
      }
    ]
