    "successText": "The vampire delivers a seismic blow, sending violent shockwaves outward. All characters within a radius of I yard per dot of Strength (42 yards per dot of Potence) must roll Dexterity Athletics, subtracting the number of successes rolled by the vampire. Those who fail are knocked prone and lose their next action. This power only affects those standing on, or braced against, the struck surface.",
