  {
    "group": "Tartarus",
    "level": 4,
    "name": "Spear of Zeus",
    "flavor": "There are no weapons too large for the Beast. The ancients tell of gods hurling bolts of lightning, but even their myths fall short of what this power allows. For the vampire who wields Tartarus, trees become javelins, vehicles become clubs, and boulders become arrows. This is not grace. This is not precision. It is brutal, godless physics—where mass meets velocity under the command of the damned. The world becomes ammunition. And nothing stands where the Spear of Zeus lands.",
