  {
    "group": "Hekate",
    "name": "Oppress the Heart",
    "category": "Chantry",
    "flavor": "When elders of the Tremere gather, the world grows a little darker that night. For those poor souls who are in attendance, such dreary dread can be tantamount to suicide. Thus the magi have found a way to suppress a vampire's Bloodline curse for a single evening. This respite only marks a stark pain when it comes back the following nights.",
