    "successText": "The magi uses the entire point of Vitae spent for this ritual to write markings of clarity upon the target (or themselves if this is for them). This suppresses the Bloodline curse for that one individual. It also suppresses all of their emotions, giving them a cold and detached demeanor.\n\nYou may spend 1 Willpower and use an Erudition if you already have established Pillar of Self to tie this ritual to the location of Pillar of Self. This causes all those within that area to be affected by Oppress the Heart. If they spend a point of Willpower, they may overcome the effects of this ritual in this area.",
    "sourcePage": 200
  },
