    "failureText": "You take the full brunt of whatever power was aimed at you.",
    "successText": "This power can be used to \"dodge\" any incoming attack of a mystical nature, including any Disciplines that target the character, whether or not they actually inflict damage. Successes the player rolls are subtracted from the successes on the attacker's roll. The Sign does not serve to turn aside magically enhanced physical attacks; a punch from a vampire using Potence still has the full effect. While this can be used reflexively like a dodge, using it and another action in a turn requires multiple actions.",
