    "successText": "Should such a mortal be given the Embrace, rather than awake undead, this sorcery will restore her life. The mortal then sleeps for a full night and day, waking sick but unharmed. The target is immune to the Embrace for a number of months equal to the Blood Potency of the magi. You can Burn a dot of Willpower to make the effect permanent. Note that this sorcery does not protect against any other form of death; if a vampire drains the unfortunate victim dry and then decapitates her, she dies just the same.",
    "sourcePage": 201
