    "successText": "The magi is alerted of anyone who enters or exits this perimeter for the duration of that night. The magi knows where and from which direction the intrusion or escape came. Each consecutive night 1 Vitae is spent the perimeter remains. The magi may Burn a dot of Willpower to forever emblazon the area with this perimeter ward. No discipline or power will override this ward and allow someone to pass unnoticed. By air, or by walking, or any other means, it does not matter. Any entrance with a rough sphere of this area alerts the magi.",
