  },
  {
    "group": "Noctis",
    "name": "Shadow Step",
    "category": "Dark Reflections",
    "flavor": "Stepping into a nearby shadow, the user disappears only to reappear from the same or another shadow further away. The vampire must enter a shadow large enough to cover them, and emerge from another one turn later. The target shadow must be within sight, though it can be perceived by mystical means. It is possible to bring something the size of your vampire or smaller through the passage, if it is a person and they are unwilling, they must be held by a successful grapple.",
    "vitaeCost": 2,
